  {
   "id": "iracing-arcade-373274@major-2026-08-21",
   "gameId": "iracing-arcade-373274",
   "displayName": "The Update Is LIVE! 🏁",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-08-21T11:05:28.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Good news!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "iRacing Arcade has launched on consoles, and with it, we're releasing 4 player split screen as well as a content update introducing five new layouts and four new cars.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Four-Player Local Split-Screen",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The biggest addition is local split-screen multiplayer for up to four players.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Grab some controllers, put everyone on the same screen, and race against your friends and family from the same couch. It’s fast, chaotic, competitive, and exactly the kind of experience we wanted iRacing Arcade to deliver on consoles and PC.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Four New Cars",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The launch also introduces four very different additions to the iRacing Arcade roster:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Formula Fangio (60’s formula-style car)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Formula Turbo (80’s formula-style car)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Mercedes 190 E DTM car",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Big Rig",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Four New Circuits and Five New Layouts",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Players will also have four new officially licensed circuits to explore, including two distinct versions of Monza:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Circuito de Jerez - Ángel Nieto",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Circuit de Nevers Magny-Cours",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Autodromo Nazionale Monza - Grand Prix",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Autodromo Nazionale Monza - Historic",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Misano World Circuit Marco Simoncelli",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "These additions join iRacing Arcade’s existing collection of pocket-sized real-world and fantasy circuits, giving players even more places to race across Career, Free Play, Time Attack, and Multiplayer.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Free PC Update Arriving Friday",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "All four new cars, all five new circuit layouts, four-player local split-screen, and the other features included with the console release are coming to the PC version of iRacing Arcade on Friday, August 21, as a free update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Existing PC players will receive all of the new content and features at no additional cost.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Cars Also Included",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fiat 500",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
