      },
      {
       "text": "Kyalami Grand Prix Circuit",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Build Your Racing Organization",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "At the heart of iRacing Arcade is an extensive career mode that takes you from the grassroots of road racing to premier machinery such as GTP and the Porsche 911 GT3 Cup.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Between races, you’ll build and customize your own motorsports Campus, construct new garages and facilities, unlock boosts, hire drivers, and manage multiple racing series as your organization grows.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Whether you want to build a motorsport empire, chase global leaderboard times, battle the AI, race online, or settle things on the couch with three friends, iRacing Arcade is built to put fun first.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "See you on track!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
